"},{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取network-traffic数据集的README说明","path":"/mnt/datasets/network-traffic/schema/README.md"},"id":"call_0658d6d5e2844833895a5695","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":11974,"output_tokens":182,"total_tokens":12156,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":66}}},{"content":"canonical_fields:\n  timestamp:\n    - timestamp\n    - ts\n    - time\n    - event_time\n    - start_time\n    - flow_start\n    - first_seen\n  end_time:\n    - end_time\n    - end_timestamp\n    - flow_end\n    - last_seen\n  relative_time_s:\n    - relative_time_s\n    - time_relative_s\n    - frame.time_relative\n  start_relative_time_s:\n    - start_relative_time_s\n    - flow_start_relative_s\n    - relative_start_time_s\n  end_relative_time_s:\n    - end_relative_time_s\n    - flow_end_relative_s\n    - relative_end_time_s\n  time_is_relative:\n    - time_is_relative\n    - uses_relative_time\n    - relative_time_flag\n  src_ip:\n    - src_ip\n    - source_ip\n    - src\n    - sip\n    - src_addr\n    - source_address\n  dst_ip:\n    - dst_ip\n    - destination_ip\n    - dest_ip\n    - dst\n    - dip\n    - dst_addr\n    - destination_address\n  src_port:\n    - src_port\n    - source_port\n    - sport\n    - l4_src_port\n  dst_port:\n    - dst_port\n    - destination_port\n    - dest_port\n    - dport\n    - l4_dst_port\n  protocol:\n    - protocol\n    - proto\n    - l4_proto\n    - transport\n  app_protocol:\n    - app_protocol\n    - application_protocol\n    - app_proto\n    - l7_proto\n  service:\n    - service\n    - app_service\n    - destination_service\n  bytes:\n    - bytes\n    - byte_count\n    - bytes_total\n    - total_bytes\n    - octets\n    - in_bytes\n  packets:\n    - packets\n    - packet_count\n    - total_packets\n    - pkts\n  flow_duration:\n    - flow_duration\n    - duration\n    - session_duration\n    - elapsed_ms\n  duration_ms:\n    - duration_ms\n    - elapsed_ms\n    - duration_millis\n    - session_duration_ms\n  session_state:\n    - session_state\n    - state\n    - connection_state\n    - flow_state\n  rule_name:\n    - rule_name\n    - rule\n    - policy_rule\n    - detection_rule\n  tcp_flags:\n    - tcp_flags\n    - tcp_flags_seen\n    - flags\n  dns_query:\n    - dns_query\n    - dns_qname\n    - query_name\n    - domain\n  tls_sni:\n    - tls_sni\n    - sni\n    - server_name\n    - tls_server_name\n  http_host:\n    - http_host\n    - host\n    - http_hostname\n  direction:\n    - direction\n    - traffic_direction\n    - flow_direction\n  action:\n    - action\n    - status\n    - outcome\n    - verdict\n    - decision\n  flow_start_reason:\n    - flow_start_reason\n    - session_start_reason\n    - start_reason\n  flow_end_reason:\n    - flow_end_reason\n    - session_end_reason\n    - end_reason\n  asset_id:\n    - asset_id\n    - host_id\n    - endpoint_id\n  user_id:\n    - user_id\n    - username\n    - account_id\n  device_id:\n    - device_id\n    - appliance_id\n    - sensor_device_id\n  sensor_id:\n    - sensor_id\n    - probe_id\n    - sensor\n  dataset_label:\n    - dataset_label\n    - dataset\n    - dataset_name\n  traffic_family:\n    - traffic_family\n    - traffic_type\n    - family\ndefault_metrics:\n  - count\n  - sum:bytes\n  - sum:packets\n  - avg:flow_duration\nprofiles:\n  wireshark_packet:\n    canonical_fields:\n      timestamp:\n        - frame.time_epoch\n        - frame.time\n        - frame.time_relative\n      src_ip:\n        - ip.src\n        - ipv6.src\n      dst_ip:\n        - ip.dst\n        - ipv6.dst\n      src_port:\n        - tcp.srcport\n        - udp.srcport\n      dst_port:\n        - tcp.dstport\n        - udp.dstport\n      protocol:\n        - _ws.col.Protocol\n        - frame.protocols\n        - ip.proto\n      frame_len:\n        - frame.len\n      payload_bytes:\n        - tcp.len\n        - udp.length\n        - ip.len\n      tcp_flags:\n        - tcp.flags.str\n        - tcp.flags\n      ttl:\n        - ip.ttl\n        - ipv6.hlim\n      ip_version:\n        - ip.version\n      icmp_type:\n        - icmp.type\n      icmp_code:\n        - icmp.code\n      dns_query:\n        - dns.qry.name\n      tls_sni:\n        - tls.handshake.extensions_server_name\n      http_host:\n        - http.host\n      mac_src:\n        - eth.src\n      mac_dst:\n        - eth.dst\nnotes:\n  - \"Add aliases here when a new vendor or export format uses different column names.\"\n  - \"Canonical fields are used to build the unified 'flows' view for network-traffic-analysis.\"\n  - \"Profiles let the script auto-detect common export formats such as Wireshark/tshark without rewriting source columns.\"\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"aceb7fb7-5375-465b-a6ae-56243954872f","tool_call_id":"call_24bd7affc76248e793b51960","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"# Network Traffic Dataset Schema\n\nThis folder stores local, tracked configuration for the network traffic analysis workflow.\n\nFiles:\n\n- `field_mapping.yaml`: canonical field aliases used by the skill script\n  - supports shared aliases plus source-specific profiles such as `wireshark_packet`\n\nRecommended raw dataset shape:\n\n- One row per flow, session, alert, or request log\n- Prefer at least these columns when available:\n  - `timestamp` or relative-time fields such as `relative_time_s` / `start_relative_time_s`\n  - `src_ip`\n  - `dst_ip`\n  - `src_port`\n  - `dst_port`\n  - `protocol`\n  - `bytes`\n  - `packets`\n  - `flow_duration`\n  - `direction`\n  - `action`\n\nSupported input formats in phase 1:\n\n- `.csv`\n- `.parquet`\n- `.json`\n- `.jsonl`\n- `.xlsx`\n- `.xls`\n\nMapping behavior:\n\n- Source files keep their original columns.\n- The analysis script builds a canonical `flows` view for downstream actions.\n- Common vendor/export aliases can be added to `field_mapping.yaml`.\n- Source-specific profiles can be auto-detected without breaking older datasets.\n- Time-aware analysis supports both:\n  - absolute timestamps via `timestamp` / `end_time`\n  - relative capture time via `relative_time_s`, `start_relative_time_s`, `end_relative_time_s`, and `time_is_relative`\n\nPCAP preprocessing output fields:\n\n- `packet.csv` always includes the existing core fields plus:\n  - `relative_time_s`\n  - `time_is_relative`\n  - `app_protocol`\n  - `service`\n  - `ip_version`\n  - `frame_len`\n  - `ttl`\n  - `payload_bytes`\n  - `tcp_flags`\n  - `dns_query`\n  - `tls_sni`\n  - `http_host`\n  - `icmp_type`\n  - `icmp_code`\n  - `flow_id`\n  - `packet_count`\n  - `byte_count`\n  - `bytes_total`\n  - `src_bytes`\n  - `dst_bytes`\n  - `src_packets`\n  - `dst_packets`\n  - `duration_ms`\n  - `session_state`\n  - `rule_name`\n  - `device_id`\n  - `sensor_id`\n  - `vlan_id`\n  - `src_zone`\n  - `dst_zone`\n  - `src_asset_group`\n  - `dst_asset_group`\n  - `nat_src_ip`\n  - `nat_dst_ip`\n  - `dst_asn`\n  - `dst_country`\n  - `asset_id`\n  - `user_id`\n  - `dataset_label`\n  - `traffic_family`\n  - `pcap_name`\n  - `mac_src`\n  - `mac_dst`\n- `flow.csv` always includes the existing core fields plus:\n  - `end_time`\n  - `start_relative_time_s`\n  - `end_relative_time_s`\n  - `time_is_relative`\n  - `app_protocol`\n  - `service`\n  - `session_state`\n  - `flow_start_reason`\n  - `flow_end_reason`\n  - `rule_name`\n  - `tcp_flags`\n  - `ip_version`\n  - `bytes_total`\n  - `packet_count`\n  - `payload_bytes`\n  - `src_bytes`\n  - `dst_bytes`\n  - `src_packets`\n  - `dst_packets`\n  - `vlan_id`\n  - `src_zone`\n  - `dst_zone`\n  - `src_asset_group`\n  - `dst_asset_group`\n  - `nat_src_ip`\n  - `nat_dst_ip`\n  - `dst_asn`\n  - `dst_country`\n  - `dns_query`\n  - `tls_sni`\n  - `http_host`\n  - `asset_id`\n  - `user_id`\n  - `duration`\n  - `duration_ms`\n  - `flow_id`\n  - `tcp_flags_seen`\n  - `ttl_min`\n  - `ttl_max`\n  - `ttl_avg`\n  - `icmp_type`\n  - `icmp_code`\n  - `device_id`\n  - `sensor_id`\n  - `dataset_label`\n  - `traffic_family`\n\nFlow semantics:\n\n- `flow.csv` is now session-oriented rather than coarse conversation-oriented.\n- TCP flows are split using:\n  - SYN-preferring session starts\n  - FIN / RST termination\n  - idle timeout boundaries\n- Non-TCP flows are split using idle timeout boundaries.\n- Relative-time captures keep their time offsets in dedicated fields instead of being rewritten as `1970-01-01...` timestamps.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"a05dae4d-8cfb-43f5-9b6e-3ecfc96af7fa","tool_call_id":"call_0658d6d5e2844833895a5695","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":270,"prompt_tokens":14393,"total_tokens":14663,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":197,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":270},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":14393}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-68c2fb32-5c77-9510-a7f2-a733b8059193","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e60-0701-7fe1-8c2f-2903c7026829-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"find /mnt/datasets -type f -not -name \".gitkeep\" -not -name \"*.md\" | head -80","description":"查找所有可用的数据集文件"},"id":"call_3490c22f8ce64068a7d55233","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":14393,"output_tokens":270,"total_tokens":14663,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":197}}},{"content":"/mnt/datasets/streetview-demo/streetview_sample.svg\n/mnt/datasets/streetview-demo/metadata.csv\n/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/fight.mp4\n/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic-30s.mp4\n/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4\n/mnt/datasets/trajectory-demo/trajectory_points.csv\n/mnt/datasets/internal-data-employees/employees.csv\n/mnt/datasets/network-traffic/schema/field_mapping.yaml","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"17991c2d-48bf-4627-9a69-bd9b5d5e19f7","tool_call_id":"call_3490c22f8ce64068a7d55233","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":280,"prompt_tokens":14583,"total_tokens":14863,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":139,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":280},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":14583}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-f2fa723c-650a-9fdd-a9a7-65b17f7ea5ee","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e60-199e-7321-ad19-d1f28a0a1f2c-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"ask_clarification","args":{"context":"network-traffic数据集目录中的raw和processed子目录均为空，仅包含.gitkeep占位文件，没有找到实际的告警事件数据文件。","options":"[\"请上传包含告警事件的数据文件\", \"请提供具体的PCAP文件或CSV/JSON格式的数据集路径\", \"请先为我生成一套分类规则和判定框架\"]","question":"当前network-traffic数据集中没有找到实际的告警事件数据文件。请告诉我您希望使用哪种数据源？"},"id":"call_cb92680329e64d5e966d4cfd","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":14583,"output_tokens":280,"total_tokens":14863,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":139}}}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","normalized_query":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","routing_query":"场景：网络流量。场景ID：network_traffic。场景说明：网络流量、PCAP、会话、协议、异常通信、恶意流量、网络安全事件分析场景。需要识别参数：分析对象、分析目标、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把网络流量场景中的事件分为自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类","scene":"network_traffic","scene_name":"网络流量","params":{"分析对象":"事件","分析目标":"按告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响分级分类"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["network_traffic"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_3f9ec6","text":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_c8c5ff","text":"读取网络流量场景中的安全告警事件数据源，解析数据结构，定位并提取告警置信度（如评分值或模型概率）、证据完整性（如PCAP抓包数量、日志关联深度、会话状态记录）及潜在影响（如目标资产重要性、暴露面范围、敏感数据标识）等核心字段。"},{"task_span_id":"span_cf95a4","text":"结合网络安全事件处置规范，构建三级分类判定逻辑与判断口径，明确各维度阈值及组合规则，例如设定高置信度加完整证据链加低风险触发自动通过，中高置信度加证据缺口或高风险触发优先复核，其余情形归入需要人工复核。"},{"task_span_id":"span_b2d64c","text":"将解析后的事件指标代入判定规则进行逐项匹配与交叉评估，计算综合分类结果，输出带有分类标签、关键指标快照及规则命中详情的阶段性结构化结果集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_ba0b4c","text":"对分类结果进行聚合校验与格式规范化，生成可溯源的分类明细清单，附带各类别事件的数量分布、典型样本特征描述及差异化处置流转建议，完成最终交付物封装。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_414db3","scene":"network_traffic","scene_name":"网络流量","text":"我将根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把网络流量场景中的事件分为自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","params":{"分析对象":"事件","分析目标":"按告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响分级分类"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_414db3","scene":"network_traffic","scene_name":"网络流量","text":"我将根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把网络流量场景中的事件分为自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","params":{"分析对象":"事件","分析目标":"按告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响分级分类"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：分析对象。需要分析的网络流量文件、数据集或场景名称，如 pcap、pcapng、Neris、DNS、HTTP、TLS、会话日志等","提取可选参数：分析目标。用户希望识别、统计或总结的目标，如异常通信、恶意流量、协议分布、主机行为、IOC、攻击链等","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的结果形式，如 summary、报告、表格、图表、证据清单等"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:65984f46-c5c1-4d9a-ab7c-f5aec379050e"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":false,"primary_goal":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","scene":"network_traffic","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":[],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":0.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":[],"sele